Unrelated pre-existing defect observed during NEARS-2707's regression sweep (app launch,
before login, before any refund-related interaction). Facebook SDK's app-access-token
check fails with an OAuth error indicating the backing Facebook Developer app was deleted:

E/com.facebook.GraphResponse(23412): {HttpStatus: 400, errorCode: 190, subErrorCode: -1,
errorType: OAuthException, errorMessage: Error validating application. Application has
been deleted.}

Recurred 4+ times across the session (repeated retries). Not related to this ticket's
diff (Admin/app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/OrderController.php refund_request + a business_settings
migration) — this fires unconditionally on cold app start regardless of feature under test.
Likely affects Facebook login/share if those are live features. Filed as regression_bugs,
non-blocking for NEARS-2707.
